Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Xfce4 desktop panel
  The Xfce4 panel is a lightweight desktop panel for the Xfce desktop
  environment. It provides application launchers, window management,
  workspace switching, and a plugin system for additional functionality
  including system tray, clock, and application menus.
